<li><strong>Contents damage</strong> to textiles, electronics, artwork, and documents.</li>
<li><strong>Corrosion</strong> of metal surfaces and electronics from acidic soot residue.</li>
<li><strong>Commercial inventory and equipment</strong> exposed to smoke (see <a href="/services/commercial-property-claims/">commercial property claims</a>).</li>
</ul>

